The level of Ludios is corrected when the portal is created. Every level 
after 10th that doesn't have the quest portal, is not bones and has a 
vault has 2/3 chance of getting the portal to Ludios. This happens until 
either the portal is created or all levels between 10th and the Medusa 
are created.

So if you drop several levels through a trapdoor and bypass a level 
between 10th and the Medusa and continue down. There is still a chance 
that the Ludios portal is created on that bypassed level when you come 
back up if it hasn't already been created.

